Patch contains fixes for issues specific to VRAN

Signed-off-by:  Iulian Mocanu <iulian.mocanu@windriver.com>
Signed-off-by:  Michael Lemos <michael.lemos@intel.com>
Signed-off-by:  Timothy Miskell  <timothy.miskell@intel.com>
